    <x:String x:Key="LOCCrashWindowTitle">Whoops! Something went wrong…</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="LOCCrashDescription">An unrecoverable error has occurred.

If you would like to help us fix this issue, please briefly describe the actions taken before the crash, and then send diagnostic information. If you are online, the package will be uploaded to the Playnite server for analysis.

Alternatively, you can click on the &apos;Report Crash&apos; button to create a new GitHub issue and report the crash manually.

Thank you for your help.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="LOCExtCrashDescription">Extension &quot;{0}&quot; caused an unrecoverable error.

We recommend saving the log file and reporting the issue to extension&apos;s developer. If the issue keeps reoccurring, disable the extension.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="LOCExtCrashDescriptionFS">Extension &quot;{0}&quot; caused an unrecoverable error.

We recommend reporting the issue to extension&apos;s developer. If the issue keeps reoccurring, disable the extension.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="LOCExtCrashDescriptionUknown">Unknown extension or a theme caused an unrecoverable error.

We recommend disabling 3rd party add-ons, isolating the problematic one and reporting the issue to add-on&apos;s developer.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="LOCCrashDescriptionFullscreen">Unrecoverable error occurred.

If you want to help us fix this issue, please send diagnostic information. Thank you.</x:String>
