    <x:String x:Key="LOCFirstWindowTitle">First Time Configuration</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="LOCFirstIntro">This process will guide you through an automatic import and configuration of external game libraries. Playnite can automatically import games from multiple game services, such as Steam or GOG.

Keep in mind that you can also manually add any custom or emulated game for any platform later from main menu.</x:String>
