    <x:String x:Key="LOCSortingNameAutofillTooltip">When you edit a game, add games via a library update, an emulator folder scan, or a normal folder scan, automatically fill the &quot;Sorting Name&quot; field with a better sortable representation of the game&apos;s name. For example &quot;The Witcher 3&quot; will get a Sorting Name of &quot;Witcher 03&quot;. This will never set a sorting name that doesn&apos;t differ from the game name, and it will only automatically update sorting names that are empty.</x:String>
